<!-- The official warning's mark (Fase 11), drawn and never the character ⚠: Roboto has
     no U+26A0 and the phone would fetch it from whatever symbol font it has, in a hand
     of its own — the same reason ic_verdict_* exist. Same 2.4 stroke, same 24 box, same
     round caps and joins, so a warning line sits beside a verdict mark without either
     looking heavier. Tinted with the level's ink wherever it is shown (DESIGN §8.13). -->
